{"seq":2,"slug":"endpoint-descriptions","title":"接口描述规范","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/technical-writing/api-documentation/endpoint-descriptions","wordCount":1068,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"接口描述规范\">接口描述规范</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>接口描述是 API 参考文档的主体，它为每个接口提供一份<strong>自包含、可复制执行</strong>的规格说明。判断一份接口描述是否合格的唯一标准是：开发者能否仅凭这一页完成调用并正确处理返回。</p>\n<p>接口描述由四类信息构成：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>语义</strong>：HTTP 方法 + 路径表达的操作意图</li>\n<li><strong>参数</strong>：路径、查询、请求头、请求体四类输入的约束</li>\n<li><strong>示例</strong>：可运行的请求与贴近真实的响应样本</li>\n<li><strong>边界</strong>：幂等性、副作用、分页和失败用例</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[接口描述] --&gt; B[方法与路径]&#10;    A --&gt; C[参数表]&#10;    A --&gt; D[请求与响应示例]&#10;    A --&gt; E[边界说明]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[路径参数]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[查询参数]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[请求头]&#10;    C --&gt; C4[请求体]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[幂等性]&#10;    E --&gt; E2[副作用]&#10;    E --&gt; E3[失败用例]\">graph TD\n    A[接口描述] --&gt; B[方法与路径]\n    A --&gt; C[参数表]\n    A --&gt; D[请求与响应示例]\n    A --&gt; E[边界说明]\n    C --&gt; C1[路径参数]\n    C --&gt; C2[查询参数]\n    C --&gt; C3[请求头]\n    C --&gt; C4[请求体]\n    E --&gt; E1[幂等性]\n    E --&gt; E2[副作用]\n    E --&gt; E3[失败用例]</pre><p>参数约束和示例必须成对出现——只列参数不给示例，读者无法判断格式；只给示例不列约束，读者无法处理边界输入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"http-方法描述\">HTTP 方法描述</h2><p>每个接口描述应以 HTTP 方法 + 路径作为标题，紧跟一句话概要：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>HTTP 方法</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>描述模板</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GET</td>\n<td>查询</td>\n<td>获取 {资源} 的 {详情/列表}</td>\n<td>获取用户详情</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>POST</td>\n<td>创建</td>\n<td>创建一个新的 {资源}</td>\n<td>创建订单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PUT</td>\n<td>全量更新</td>\n<td>更新 {资源} 的全部字段</td>\n<td>更新用户信息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PATCH</td>\n<td>部分更新</td>\n<td>更新 {资源} 的部分字段</td>\n<td>修改订单状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DELETE</td>\n<td>删除</td>\n<td>删除指定的 {资源}</td>\n<td>删除收货地址</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"参数表规范\">参数表规范</h2><p>接口参数按位置分为四类，每类应使用独立的表格描述：</p>\n<h3 id=\"路径参数-path-parameters\">路径参数 (Path Parameters)</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数名</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>必填</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>id</td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>用户唯一标识</td>\n<td><code>usr_8a3b9c</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>orgId</td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>组织 ID</td>\n<td><code>org_12345</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"查询参数-query-parameters\">查询参数 (Query Parameters)</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数名</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>必填</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>page</td>\n<td>integer</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>页码</td>\n<td><code>3</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pageSize</td>\n<td>integer</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>每页条数，最大 100</td>\n<td><code>50</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>sort</td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>createdAt</td>\n<td>排序字段</td>\n<td><code>updatedAt</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>order</td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>desc</td>\n<td>排序方向</td>\n<td><code>asc</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"请求头参数-header-parameters\">请求头参数 (Header Parameters)</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数名</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>必填</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Authorization</td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>Bearer Token，格式：<code>Bearer {token}</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Content-Type</td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>请求体类型，固定为 <code>application/json</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>X-Request-Id</td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>请求追踪 ID，用于日志关联</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"请求体参数-body-parameters\">请求体参数 (Body Parameters)</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数名</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>必填</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>约束</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>name</td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>用户姓名</td>\n<td>1-50 个字符</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>email</td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>邮箱地址</td>\n<td>RFC 5322 格式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>role</td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>角色</td>\n<td>枚举：<code>admin</code>、<code>member</code>、<code>viewer</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>tags</td>\n<td>string[]</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>标签列表</td>\n<td>最多 10 个</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"请求与响应文档\">请求与响应文档</h2><h3 id=\"请求体示例\">请求体示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;张三&quot;,&#10;  &quot;email&quot;: &quot;zhangsan@example.com&quot;,&#10;  &quot;role&quot;: &quot;member&quot;,&#10;  &quot;tags&quot;: [&quot;开发&quot;, &quot;后端&quot;]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"张三\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"email\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"zhangsan@example.com\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"role\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"member\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tags\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"开发\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"后端\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"响应体结构\">响应体结构</h3><p>统一的响应格式有助于客户端解析：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;code&quot;: 0,&#10;  &quot;message&quot;: &quot;success&quot;,&#10;  &quot;data&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;id&quot;: &quot;usr_8a3b9c&quot;,&#10;    &quot;name&quot;: &quot;张三&quot;,&#10;    &quot;email&quot;: &quot;zhangsan@example.com&quot;,&#10;    &quot;role&quot;: &quot;member&quot;,&#10;    &quot;createdAt&quot;: &quot;2025-03-15T10:30:00Z&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"message\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"success\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"data\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"usr_8a3b9c\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"张三\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"email\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"zhangsan@example.com\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"role\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"member\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"createdAt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2025-03-15T10:30:00Z\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>code</td>\n<td>integer</td>\n<td>业务状态码，0 表示成功</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>message</td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>状态描述</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>data</td>\n<td>object</td>\n<td>业务数据，失败时可为 null</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"接口调用示例\">接口调用示例</h2><p>每个接口应提供至少两种语言的调用示例：</p>\n<h3 id=\"curl\">curl</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"curl -X POST https://api.example.com/v2/users \\&#10;  -H &quot;Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9...&quot; \\&#10;  -H &quot;Content-Type: application/json&quot; \\&#10;  -d &#39;{&#10;    &quot;name&quot;: &quot;张三&quot;,&#10;    &quot;email&quot;: &quot;zhangsan@example.com&quot;,&#10;    &quot;role&quot;: &quot;member&quot;&#10;  }&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">curl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -X</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> POST</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://api.example.com/v2/users</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -H</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9...\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -H</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Content-Type: application/json\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"name\": \"张三\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"email\": \"zhangsan@example.com\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"role\": \"member\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  }'</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"javascript-fetch\">JavaScript (fetch)</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const response = await fetch(&#39;https://api.example.com/v2/users&#39;, {&#10;  method: &#39;POST&#39;,&#10;  headers: {&#10;    Authorization: &#39;Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9...&#39;,&#10;    &#39;Content-Type&#39;: &#39;application/json&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  body: JSON.stringify({&#10;    name: &#39;张三&#39;,&#10;    email: &#39;zhangsan@example.com&#39;,&#10;    role: &#39;member&#39;,&#10;  }),&#10;});&#10;&#10;const result = await response.json();&#10;console.log(result.data.id);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> response</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://api.example.com/v2/users'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  method: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'POST'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  headers: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Authorization: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9...'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'Content-Type'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'application/json'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  body: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stringify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'张三'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    email: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'zhangsan@example.com'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    role: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'member'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result.data.id);</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"分页文档\">分页文档</h2><p>分页是列表类接口的核心要素，文档中必须详细说明分页机制。</p>\n<h3 id=\"偏移量分页-offset-pagination\">偏移量分页 (Offset Pagination)</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"GET /v2/users?page=2&amp;pageSize=20\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>GET /v2/users?page=2&#x26;pageSize=20</span></span></code></pre></div><p>响应中包含分页元数据：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;code&quot;: 0,&#10;  &quot;data&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;items&quot;: [],&#10;    &quot;pagination&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;page&quot;: 2,&#10;      &quot;pageSize&quot;: 20,&#10;      &quot;total&quot;: 156,&#10;      &quot;totalPages&quot;: 8&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"data\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"items\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"pagination\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"page\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"pageSize\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"total\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">156</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"totalPages\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"游标分页-cursor-pagination\">游标分页 (Cursor Pagination)</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"GET /v2/events?cursor=evt_abc123&amp;limit=50\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>GET /v2/events?cursor=evt_abc123&#x26;limit=50</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;code&quot;: 0,&#10;  &quot;data&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;items&quot;: [],&#10;    &quot;cursor&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;next&quot;: &quot;evt_xyz789&quot;,&#10;      &quot;hasMore&quot;: true&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"data\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"items\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"cursor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"next\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"evt_xyz789\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"hasMore\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"分页方式对比\">分页方式对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>偏移量分页</td>\n<td>支持跳页，实现简单</td>\n<td>深翻页性能差，数据偏移</td>\n<td>后台管理列表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>游标分页</td>\n<td>性能稳定，无数据偏移</td>\n<td>不支持跳页</td>\n<td>动态数据流、时间线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Keyset 分页</td>\n<td>高性能，适合大数据集</td>\n<td>只能顺序翻页</td>\n<td>日志查询、审计记录</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>参数约束必须明确</strong>：类型、长度、枚举值、默认值缺一不可</li>\n<li><strong>响应示例贴近真实</strong>：避免使用 <code>string</code>、<code>xxx</code> 等占位符</li>\n<li><strong>标注幂等性</strong>：PUT 和 DELETE 通常是幂等的，POST 通常不是</li>\n<li><strong>说明副作用</strong>：接口触发的异步操作（如发送邮件）应在文档中说明</li>\n<li><strong>展示失败用例</strong>：除成功响应外，展示常见的失败响应样本</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>接口描述应自包含、可复制执行，让开发者仅凭一页完成调用</li>\n<li>用 HTTP 方法 + 路径作标题并配一句话概要，方法语义与操作意图对齐</li>\n<li>路径、查询、请求头、请求体四类参数各用独立表格，约束与示例缺一不可</li>\n<li>每个接口提供至少两种语言的调用示例，响应示例避免使用占位符</li>\n<li>分页需说明机制并对比偏移量、游标、Keyset 三种方式的适用场景</li>\n<li>明确标注幂等性与副作用，并展示常见失败响应</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"接口描述规范","id":"接口描述规范"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"HTTP 方法描述","id":"http-方法描述"},{"level":2,"text":"参数表规范","id":"参数表规范"},{"level":3,"text":"路径参数 (Path Parameters)","id":"路径参数-path-parameters"},{"level":3,"text":"查询参数 (Query Parameters)","id":"查询参数-query-parameters"},{"level":3,"text":"请求头参数 (Header Parameters)","id":"请求头参数-header-parameters"},{"level":3,"text":"请求体参数 (Body Parameters)","id":"请求体参数-body-parameters"},{"level":2,"text":"请求与响应文档","id":"请求与响应文档"},{"level":3,"text":"请求体示例","id":"请求体示例"},{"level":3,"text":"响应体结构","id":"响应体结构"},{"level":2,"text":"接口调用示例","id":"接口调用示例"},{"level":3,"text":"curl","id":"curl"},{"level":3,"text":"JavaScript (fetch)","id":"javascript-fetch"},{"level":2,"text":"分页文档","id":"分页文档"},{"level":3,"text":"偏移量分页 (Offset Pagination)","id":"偏移量分页-offset-pagination"},{"level":3,"text":"游标分页 (Cursor Pagination)","id":"游标分页-cursor-pagination"},{"level":3,"text":"分页方式对比","id":"分页方式对比"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"API 参考文档设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/technical-writing/api-documentation/api-reference-design"},"next":{"title":"错误码文档","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/technical-writing/api-documentation/error-codes"}}